\f0\fs24 \cf0 # AI-Based Subtitle Generation Script\
\
An advanced Python application that automates the process of generating subtitles for videos. This script uses the Whisper AI model for automatic language detection, transcription, and timestamp generation, making the creation of accurate subtitles fast and efficient. \
\
